  "strings": [
    "In ages past\u0000",
    "the Dark Lord seized Minas Morgul and corrupted it with vile sorcery.\u0000",
    "It became the Witch-king's foul domain, illuminated still by pale corpse-light.\u0000",
    "Both Orcs and Sauron's magic guard this fortress...\u0000",
    "sapping the strength of all who venture near.\u0000",
    "And hovering above, Ringwraiths still guard this city well.\u0000",
    "Through siegecraft and strength of arms\u0000",
    "the Men of the West must shatter the gates of this citadel\u0000",
    "and subdue the evil within.\u0000"
  ]
